### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/

### Signup
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bhaskar",
  "email": "bhaskar@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bhaskar@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Get Menu
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/menu

### Checkout (protected)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/checkout
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Yard Special",
      "price": 15,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "total": 15,
  "deliveryAddress": {
    "street": "123 Main St",
    "city": "Sydney",
    "state": "NSW",
    "postcode": "2000"
  }
}